      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JAYJAYBENNY (2) settled close to the pace but could only manage sixth last start over 1980m at this track, failing to emulate his success at this track the run before. No excuses from this advantageous draw. Good enough to take out a race like this. METALLICA MAN (8) had to dig deep to score at the most recent appearance over 1609m at Newcastle, getting home by just 1.75 metres. Should enjoy a nice smother from this draw and will be looking for a split at some stage. Leading hope in a similar assignment. SUNDAY MORNINGS (1) is on the radar after his last-start fifth over 1980m at this track a week ago. VINCENTIUS MAXIMUS (7) disappointed last time when eighth over 1609m at Menangle. Can do a lot better so worth considering.",
